 <h3><u>Jafar ka janaza</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haye jafar e sadiq.. haye jafar e sadiq..(2)<br> Kazim utha rahe hai jafar ka janaza..(2)</p> 
  <p>Haye hussain kehkar aansu baha rahe hai<br> kazim utha rahe hai jafar ka janaza..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Taboot ko utha kar kitne qadam badhaye<br> har ek qadam pe unko sajjad yaad aaye<br> abid ki bebasi ka nauha suna rahe hai</p> 
  <p>2. Mansoor ne ghiza mein zehre jafa diya tha<br> mazloom ke badan par jiska asar hua tha<br> aflaak se malaek purse ko aa rahe hai</p> 
  <p>3. Nikla dahan se bahar aaye jigar jo kat kar<br> khoo'n rang hogaya tha maula ka mere bistar<br> manzar ye ehle dil ke dil ko dukha rahe hai</p> 
  <p>4. Haider se dushmani ye ab tak nahi ruki hai<br> maula hasan se lekar jafar tak aagayi hai<br> har ek charagh e zehra zalim bujha rahe hai</p> 
  <p>5. Aulad e sayyeda mein aysa hai ye janaza<br> jisme madine wale dene ko aaye pursa<br> ehle madina saare ye ghum mana rahe hai</p> 
  <p>6. Jafar ke zehn mein bhi kazim ka hai janaza<br> mayyat uthane wala waris koi na hoga<br> zere kafan bhi jafar khoo'n rote jaa rahe hai</p> 
  <p>7. Salman aur meesum dekha ye khwaab aksar<br> baad e zahoor maula Mehdi baqi mein aakar<br> Zehra ka aur inka roza bana rahe hai</p> 
